        "enter-fail :parameters (?entity - character ?locationfrom - room ?roomto - room) :precondition (and (not (believes-locked ?entity ?roomto)) (believes-at ?entity ?entity ?locationfrom) (not (and (not (locked ?roomto)) (at ?entity ?locationfrom)))) :effect (when (and (locked ?roomto) (at ?entity ?locationfrom)) (believes-locked ?entity ?roomto)))": "(:action enter-fail :parameters (?entity - character ?locationfrom - room ?roomto - room) :precondition (and (not (believes-locked ?entity ?roomto)) (believes-at ?entity ?entity ?locationfrom) (not (and (not (locked ?roomto)) (at ?entity ?locationfrom)))) :effect (when (and (locked ?roomto) (at ?entity ?locationfrom)) (believes-locked ?entity ?roomto)))",
